<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!-- EN: questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has requested our help in a skirmish against [siteFaction_name].\n\nA small force from [askerFaction_name] is engaging a larger group of [siteFaction_pawnsPlural]. The friendlies will attack immediately upon arrival, but their chances of victory without our help are slim.\n\nThis is an opportunity to strengthen our bond with [askerFaction_name]. However, the enemy force is significant, and this battle will not be without risk.\n\n\nAllied forces include:\n[FriendlyUnitList]\n\n\nEnemies from [siteFaction_name]:\n[EnemyUnitList] -->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] de [asker_faction_name], pediu nossa ajuda numa escaramuça contra [siteFaction_name].\n\nUma pequena força de [askerFaction_name] está enfrentando um grupo maior de [siteFaction_pawnsPlural]. Os aliados vão atacar assim que chegarmos, mas as chances de vitória sem a nossa ajuda são pequenas.\n\nÉ uma oportunidade de fortalecer os laços com [askerFaction_name]. Mas a força inimiga é grande, e essa batalha não será sem riscos.\n\n\nForças aliadas:\n[FriendlyUnitList]\n\n\nInimigos de [siteFaction_name]:\n[EnemyUnitList]</li>
  </VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
