    <li>skirmish-&gt;Escaramuça</li>
    <!-- EN: skirmish-&gt;Battle -->
    <li>skirmish-&gt;Batalha</li>
    <!-- EN: skirmish-&gt;Clash -->
    <li>skirmish-&gt;Confronto</li>
    <!-- EN: skirmish-&gt;Conflict -->
    <li>skirmish-&gt;Conflito</li>
  </VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>Missão expirada: [resolvedQuestName]</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The allied faction was defeated in the skirmish. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired. -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>A facção aliada foi derrotada na escaramuça. A missão [resolvedQuestName] expirou.</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.WorldObjectTimeout.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>Missão fracassada: [resolvedQuestName]</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: After leaving the site, the battle resolved itself without your help. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>Depois que vocês saíram do local, a batalha se resolveu sem a sua ajuda. A missão [resolvedQuestName] terminou.</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteDestroyed.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>Pagamento chegou</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterLabel.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: You have defeated the enemy forces!\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterText.slateRef>Você derrotou as forças inimigas!\n\nO pagamento de [asker_faction_name] chegou.</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.customLetterText.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.label.slateRef>[asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: These colonists participated in the victory for the quest [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service. -->
  <VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.text.slateRef>Estes colonos participaram da vitória na missão [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] quer saber quem deve receber [royalFavorReward_amount] de [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] por este serviço.</VFEM2_OpportunitySite_Skirmish.root.nodes.siteAllEnemiesDefeated.node.nodes.GiveRewards.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.text.slateRef>
